    {
      "id": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/13/homepod-mini-2-still-lacks-siri-ai/",
      "url": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/13/homepod-mini-2-still-lacks-siri-ai/",
      "title": "Siri AI Still Not Enabled on HomePod Mini 2 With Latest Software Update",
      "content_html": "Apple today released HomePod software version 27.2.1, but it <a href=\"https://x.com/itspdfu/status/2121330608358240454\">does not enable Siri AI on the HomePod mini 2</a>. Apple's website continues to say the feature is \"coming in a future software update,\" but it has not provided a timeframe.\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1070600\" height=\"1406\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/homepod-mini-2-feature2.jpg\" width=\"2500\"/>\n<br/>\nDue to the HomePod mini 2 having <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/04/homepod-mini-2-ram/\">only 2GB of RAM</a>, well below the minimum 8GB of RAM required for dedicated Siri AI, personal context requests will require a paired Apple Intelligence–enabled iPhone or iPad with Siri AI turned on. \n<br/>\n<br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/13/apple-releases-tvos-27-2-1/\">tvOS 27.2.1 was also released today</a>, and it enables Siri AI on the Apple TV 4K (2nd generation) and Apple TV 4K (3rd generation). Siri AI is an opt-in feature on these devices, so after installing the update you will need to open the Settings app and tap on General → Siri → Siri AI (Beta). This will initiate a download with support.\n<br/>\n<br/>\nIf you update to tvOS 27.2.1 and take no further action, Siri Classic remains enabled by default.<div class=\"linkback\">Related Roundup: <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/homepod-mini/\">HomePod mini 2</a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Tags: <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/\">Siri</a>, <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri-ai/\">Siri AI</a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Buyer's Guide: <a href=\"https://buyersguide.macrumors.com/#Homepod-Mini\">HomePod Mini (Buy Now)</a></div><div class=\"linkback\">Related Forum: <a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/homepod-homeview-carplay-–-home-auto-tech.193\">HomePod, HomeView, CarPlay – Home &amp; Auto Tech</a></div><br/>This article, \"<a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/13/homepod-mini-2-still-lacks-siri-ai/\">Siri AI Still Not Enabled on HomePod Mini 2 With Latest Software Update</a>\" first appeared on <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com\">MacRumors.com</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/siri-ai-still-not-enabled-on-homepod-mini-2-with-latest-software-update.2494364/\">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br/><br/>",
      "date_published": "2026-11-13T20:35:53+00:00",
